---
layout: layout.njk
---

<div class="min-h-screen bg-base-100 text-base-content">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between bg-base-100 px-8">
  <div class="flex-1">
    <a class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary">Organifanten</a>
  </div>
</div>
  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="py-6">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <div>
        <div  class="w-lg h-lg text-primary flex justify-center mx-auto my-6">{% include "elephant.njk" %}</div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-semibold leading-tight">
          Work <span class="text-primary underline">on</span> your organization <br>(not just in it).
        </h1>

        <p class="mt-6 text-lg opacity-80">
          Organifanten is your private space to work on tensions in your organization <br> over months, not sprints.
        </p>


      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- RECOGNITION -->
  <section class="py-20">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium">
        Organizational elephants are in the room.
        <br>
        It's your job to work with them.
      </h2>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <div>
            <p class="font-medium text-primary pb-4">
                This is slow work...
            </p>
            <ul class="space-y-2 opacity-90">
            <li>Tensions emerge gradually</li>
            <li>Interventions require the right timing</li>
            <li>Effects may appear months after</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
            <p class="font-medium text-primary pb-4">
            ...and your understanding keeps evolving.   
            </p>

            <ul class="space-y-2 opacity-90">
            <li>Observations are subjective</li>
            <li>Interpretations change</li>
            <li>Insights are iterative</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <ul class="list-none my-10 space-y-4">
    <li class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span>Tension noticed</span>
        <span class="shrink-0">{% include "circle_tension.njk" %}</span>
        <span class="text-sm opacity-60">January</span>
    </li>
    <li class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span>Insight A</span>
        <span class="shrink-0">{% include "circle_insight.njk" %}</span>
        <span class="text-sm opacity-60">February</span>
    </li>
    <li class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span>Intervention 1</span>
        <span class="shrink-0">{% include "circle_intervention.njk" %}</span>
        <span class="text-sm opacity-60">April</span>
    </li>
    <li class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span>Insight B</span>
        <span class="shrink-0">{% include "circle_insight.njk" %}</span>
        <span class="text-sm opacity-60">July</span>
    </li>
    <li class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span>Effect visible</span>
        <span class="shrink-0">{% include "circle_effect.njk" %}</span>
        <span class="text-sm opacity-60">August</span>
    </li>
    </ul>

    <p class="font-medium mt-6">
      Organifanten is designed for slow work and unfolding understanding.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-6">
        Got more questions? Here are our <a href="/faq/" class="text-primary underline">FAQ</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-accent">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-6">
        Working with elephants in the room:
        </h2>
      <p class="mb-12 opacity-80 text-lg">
        It’s not about quick wins or immediate action.<br>
        It is about staying with the complexity of organizational change.
      </p>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="rounded-xl bg-base-100 shadow-sm">
          <div class="p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-warning">Notice</h3>
            <p>Roughly describe tensions as you perceive them.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-xl bg-base-100 shadow-sm">
          <div class="p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-info">Plan</h3>
            <p>Prioritize which tensions you're working on and plan interventions.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-xl bg-base-100 shadow-sm">
          <div class="p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-success">Reflect</h3>
            <p>Log insights and effects as your understanding gradually evolves.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- STORY -->
<section class="py-20">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">

    <!-- TEXT (LEFT) -->
    <div class="space-y-5">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-6">
        Hi, I'm Nicolas 👋  
      </h2>

      <p>
        I’ve spent 15 years working with teams and organizations. My most important insights and ideas didn't fit into any tools. I kept notebooks, loose pages,
        scattered confluence pages, or left thoughts just in my head.
     </p><p class="mt-4">
        Organifanten started is my personal attempt to create a space where
        sense-making can unfold slowly, without pressure to be right,
        fast, or finished.
        <br>
    </p><p class="mt-4">
        It is the tool I wished I had years ago.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- IMAGE (RIGHT) -->
    <div class="flex justify-center md:justify-end">
      <img
        src="assets/NicolasMegow.jpg"
        alt="Creator of Organifanten"
        class="rounded-3xl shadow-sm w-72 md:w-80 object-cover"
      />
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<!-- BACKLOG -->
<section class="py-20">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-6">Product Backlog</h2>
        <p>I'm working on these features next to make Organifanten more useful for you and me:</p>
        <ol class="list-decimal list-inside space-y-2 mt-6">
        {% for item in backlog %}
            <li>{{ item }}</li>
        {% endfor %}
        </ol>
         <p class="font-medium mt-6">
            → Get feature updates
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/nicolas-megow/" target="_blank" class="text-primary underline"> on LinkedIn</a> or send me your ideas and feedback.
      </p>
    </div>
</section>

  {% include "footer.njk" %}

</div>